§ `Cross-references`

GIVEN c IS A `A cross-reference`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the citation points at what it says` MEANS c's `the citing words say it points at` EQUALS c's `the target is`

GIVEN c IS A `A cross-reference`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the target has everything the citing words name` MEANS c's `how many of them the target has` AT LEAST c's `how many things the citing words name`

GIVEN c IS A `A cross-reference`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the citing words name the subsection that holds what they say` MEANS c's `the label the citing words name` EQUALS c's `the label of the subsection that holds what the citing words say`

-- DEFECT I1. The words of s 5ב(א) that name the definition. The instrument that inserted them is the Act published in Sefer HaChukim 2712 (22 March 2018), s 2(1)(א); the title of that Act stands at the head of the page printed 454 and is not in the deposited crop.
-- Read from the deposited cropped image of the page printed 454 (the crop holds the opening lines of s 2, the line that introduces s 5ב(א), the instruction (א) of paragraph (1) of s 2, the line that opens s 5ב1, and the footer line, in bands separated by grey bars, and nothing else of the page).
-- The instruction continues after the words quoted with replacements of words that name the banking corporations; the crop holds them, and the row does not quote them. ASCII quotation marks stand for the printed ones.
-- ext:[SH 2712 p.454, read from the deposited cropped image] | בחוק הבנקאות (שירות ללקוח), התשמ"א–1981 (בפרק זה – חוק הבנקאות (שירות ללקוח)) –
-- ext:[SH 2712 p.454, read from the deposited cropped image] | (1) בסעיף 5ב(א) –
-- ext:[SH 2712 p.454, read from the deposited cropped image] | (א) ברישה, אחרי "את חשבונותיו" יבוא "ובכלל זה פעילות פיננסית כהגדרתה בסעיף 5ב1(ה)"
-- The consolidation prints the same opening words of s 5ב(א) (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY). The row records that it prints them, not that no instrument touched them (see NOTES.md, fork F4):
-- src:210 | (א) לקוח, המעוניין להעביר את חשבונותיו ובכלל זה פעילות פיננסית כהגדרתה בסעיף 5ב1(ה) מתאגיד בנקאי אחד (בסעיף זה – התאגיד הבנקאי המקורי) לתאגיד בנקאי אחר (בסעיף זה – התאגיד הבנקאי הקולט), או לסגור את החשבון בתאגיד הבנקאי המקורי לאחר העברת חשבונותיו רשאי לאשר, בכתב, לתאגיד הבנקאי הקולט לנהל בעבורו את כל ההליכים הקשורים במעבר כאמור, ובכלל זה לקבל –
-- The citation inside those words is "5ב1(ה)": it names section 5ב1 and, in it, subsection (ה). The words say that the term financial activity is defined there. Subsection (ה) holds the power above; the definition is in subsection (א).
`reference: s 5ב(א), the words that name the definition of financial activity` MEANS
    `A cross-reference` WITH
        `the citing words are in` IS "s 5ב(א), the opening words, as inserted by s 2(1)(א) of the Act in Sefer HaChukim 2712 (22 March 2018), printed page 454"
        `the citing words name` IS "s 5ב1, subsection (ה)"
        `the label the citing words name` IS "(ה)"
        `the citing words say it points at` IS `the definition of the term financial activity`
        `the target is` IS (`subsection: s 5ב1(ה), the power`)'s `what it holds`
        `the label of the subsection that holds what the citing words say` IS (`subsection: s 5ב1(א), the definitions`)'s `the label printed`
        `how many things the citing words name` IS 1
        `how many of them the target has` IS 0
        `limb (a) was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`
        `limb (b) was read from` IS `the official page, read from its image, and the cropped image is deposited`

